features.json is the response of the ARIA-AT app's public API (https://aria-at.w3.org/api/graphql) to the query in
fetch.sh, copied unchanged. It holds the ARIA-AT project's test results for each ARIA feature, by screen reader and
browser, as shown on https://aria-at.w3.org/reports.

